{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99387","id":2184883817,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6COq5p","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99387","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99387.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99387.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99387","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99387/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99387/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99387/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a8cd0e9677011c989a0aae8da5888805db83d620","number":99387,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Use direct composition for d3d12 backend","user":{"login":"0x0ACB","id":11277588,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjc3NTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11277588?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x0ACB","html_url":"https://github.com/0x0ACB","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x0ACB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x0ACB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x0ACB/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x0ACB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x0ACB/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x0ACB/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x0ACB/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x0ACB/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x0ACB/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/95630 and can be seen as a partial fix for https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/76167.\r\n\r\n**Update D3D12 Renderer to Use Direct Composition** \r\n\r\nThis commit updates the D3D12 renderer to use `CreateSwapChainForComposition` instead of `CreateSwapChainForHwnd`, addressing the lack of alpha support in the latter (see GodotEngine/godot#95630).\r\n\r\nSwitching to direct composition is supposed to have additional benefits according to the Microsoft documentation and other online resources. Specifically, it eliminates the need to transfer the final image to the CPU for DWM composition, which is suggested to improve performance. While I have not empirically verified these performance claims, the explanation aligns with my own research into transparency issues and DWM behavior.\r\n\r\n**Compatibility Notes**\r\n\r\n~~This change requires Windows 8 or later. However, since D3D12 is unsupported on Windows 7 (now EOL for nearly five years), this should not pose a compatibility issue.~~","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","number":20,"state":"closed","title":"4.4","de